## gql generate file setup step
1. Go to codegen site and follow the steps to generate the codegen file (https://the-guild.dev/graphql/codegen/docs/getting-started#from-the-frontend)
2. Copy the generated codegen file to the root of the project and rename it to codegen.ts
3. Install the required dependencies
4. Query structure sould be URQL React Query